{#-
  The archived-versions landing page (Stage 6d, design.md section 10.6).

  Frontmatter included, for `documents_index.md.j2`'s reason: nothing converts
  this folder, so this template is the only place it can come from.

  **A row with no URL is still a row.** 14 of the corpus's 2,100 archived versions
  carry no `zip_url` and none of them has a ZIP on disk; listing them as plain
  text says "this version existed and we cannot hand it to you", while dropping
  them would publish a history with silent gaps. That is design.md invariant 10 --
  an absence is reported, never faked -- applied to a whole version.

  `entry.link` is the remote URL untouched, or the quoted filename when the ZIP
  was copied in beside this page.
-#}
---
title: {{ title | yaml }}
doc_class: archives
generated: true
---

# {{ title }}

{% for entry in entries -%}
{% if entry.url -%}
- [{{ entry.version }}]({{ entry.link }}){% if entry.released %} -- {{ entry.released }}{% endif %}
{% else -%}
- {{ entry.version }}{% if entry.released %} -- {{ entry.released }}{% endif %} (not available)
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
